            <ArticleTitle>Complications following small joint injuries.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>329-45</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Injuries to the small joints in the hand can lead to stiffness, pain, instability, and arthrosis. Careful evaluation and an understanding of possible complications may prevent serious difficulties from occurring.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
